WEBVTT

00:02.480 --> 00:06.817
Water, earth,

00:06.901 --> 00:10.195
fire, air...

00:11.322 --> 00:15.367
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

00:15.451 --> 00:18.745
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:19.789 --> 00:23.709
Only the Avatar, master of all
four elements, could stop them.

00:23.793 --> 00:25.627
But when the world needed him most,

00:25.712 --> 00:27.004
he vanished.

00:27.422 --> 00:31.216
A hundred years passed, and my brother
and I discovered the new Avatar,

00:31.301 --> 00:32.884
an airbender named Aang.

00:32.969 --> 00:35.262
And although his
airbending skills are great,

00:35.346 --> 00:38.015
he has a lot to learn
before he's ready to save anyone.

00:38.975 --> 00:42.269
But I believe Aang can save the world.

00:59.162 --> 01:02.205
The Earth Kingdom City of Omashu!

01:05.168 --> 01:07.210
I used to always come here
to visit my friend Bumi.

01:07.295 --> 01:08.420
Wow!

01:08.504 --> 01:10.672
We don't have cities like this
in the South Pole.

01:10.882 --> 01:13.258
They have buildings here
that don't melt.

01:13.343 --> 01:14.843
Well, let's go, slowpokes.

01:14.927 --> 01:17.763
The real fun is inside the city!

01:17.847 --> 01:19.348
Wait, Aang.

01:19.432 --> 01:20.599
It could be dangerous

01:20.683 --> 01:22.184
if people find out you're the Avatar.

01:22.268 --> 01:23.643
You need a disguise.

01:23.728 --> 01:25.604
So, what am I supposed to do,

01:25.688 --> 01:26.938
grow a mustache?

01:29.400 --> 01:31.777
This is so itchy.

01:31.861 --> 01:34.071
How do you live in this stuff?

01:35.907 --> 01:36.990
Great!

01:37.075 --> 01:38.492
Now you look just like my grandfather.

01:38.701 --> 01:41.036
Technically, Aang is 112 years old.

01:42.497 --> 01:44.873
Now, let's get to skipping,
young whipper snappers!

01:45.083 --> 01:46.333
The big city awaits!

02:02.767 --> 02:04.768
You guys are gonna love Omashu.

02:04.852 --> 02:07.479
The people here are the friendliest
in the world.

02:09.232 --> 02:11.858
What kind of slum
do you think this is?

02:17.990 --> 02:19.866
No! My cabbages!

02:22.829 --> 02:24.538
Just keep smiling.

02:26.290 --> 02:27.499
Heh heh heh.

02:30.878 --> 02:32.337
State your business!

02:33.631 --> 02:35.757
My business is my business, young man,

02:35.842 --> 02:37.217
and none of yours.

02:37.301 --> 02:39.177
I've got half a mind
to bend you over my knee

02:39.262 --> 02:40.720
and paddle your backside.

02:40.805 --> 02:42.764
Settle down, old timer.

02:42.849 --> 02:44.224
Just tell me who you are.

02:44.308 --> 02:49.187
Name's Bonzoo Pippenpadlopsicopolis
the Third.

02:49.272 --> 02:51.314
And these are my grandkids.

02:51.399 --> 02:53.525
Hi. June Pippenpadlopsicopolis.

02:53.609 --> 02:54.609
Nice to meet you.

02:56.279 --> 02:58.864
You seem like
a responsible young lady.

02:58.948 --> 03:01.241
See that your grandfather
stays out of trouble.

03:01.325 --> 03:02.325
Enjoy Omashu.

03:02.410 --> 03:03.618
We will.

03:06.956 --> 03:08.123
Wait a minute!

03:10.710 --> 03:13.003
You're a strong young boy.

03:13.087 --> 03:14.546
Show some respect for the elderly

03:14.630 --> 03:16.548
and carry your grandfather's bag.

03:17.258 --> 03:18.550
Good idea.

03:46.454 --> 03:48.914
This is
the Omashu delivery system...

03:49.123 --> 03:51.374
Miles and miles of tubes and chutes.

03:53.753 --> 03:56.379
Earthbending brings the packages up,

03:56.464 --> 03:58.381
and gravity brings them down.

03:59.383 --> 04:01.384
Great, so they get their mail on time.

04:01.469 --> 04:03.094
They do get their mail on time.

04:03.179 --> 04:06.681
But my friend Bumi
found a better use for these chutes.

04:10.269 --> 04:11.478
Look around you!

04:11.562 --> 04:12.562
What do you see?!

04:12.647 --> 04:15.273
Um... The mail system.

04:15.358 --> 04:17.317
Instead of seeing
what they want you to see,

04:17.401 --> 04:20.403
you gotta open your brain
to the possibilities.

04:20.488 --> 04:22.822
A package-sending system?

04:22.907 --> 04:25.909
The world's greatest super slide!

04:25.993 --> 04:28.703
Bumi, you're a mad genius.

04:36.003 --> 04:37.629
Yeah! Ha ha ha ha!

04:40.633 --> 04:41.800
One ride...

04:42.051 --> 04:43.843
Then we're off to the North Pole...

04:43.928 --> 04:45.220
Airbender's honor.

04:45.304 --> 04:46.429
This sounded like fun at first,

04:46.514 --> 04:48.598
but now that I'm here,

04:48.683 --> 04:52.227
I'm starting to have second thoughts!

04:57.400 --> 04:58.733
Yeah!

04:58.943 --> 05:00.360
Ha ha ha ha!

05:14.750 --> 05:15.834
I'm on it!

05:20.798 --> 05:24.092
Men, you'll be going off
to combat soon.

05:24.176 --> 05:26.845
It's important that you be prepared
for anything.

05:36.022 --> 05:37.564
Aang, do something!

05:37.648 --> 05:39.357
Use your airbending!

05:39.442 --> 05:41.151
Yeah! Good idea!

05:41.235 --> 05:43.028
That will make us go even faster.

06:18.856 --> 06:19.939
Sorry!

06:37.083 --> 06:38.667
My cabbages!

06:38.751 --> 06:40.251
You're gonna pay for this!

06:42.088 --> 06:43.546
Two cabbages, please.

06:57.978 --> 06:59.145
Your Majesty,

06:59.230 --> 07:01.606
these juveniles were arrested
for vandalism,

07:01.691 --> 07:03.066
traveling under false pretenses,

07:03.150 --> 07:04.818
and malicious destruction of cabbages.

07:04.902 --> 07:06.194
Off with their heads!

07:06.278 --> 07:07.987
One for each head of cabbage!

07:08.072 --> 07:09.364
Silence!

07:09.448 --> 07:11.700
Only the king can pass down judgment.

07:11.784 --> 07:13.284
What is your judgment, sire?

07:25.881 --> 07:28.174
Throw them...

07:28.259 --> 07:29.342
A feast.

07:41.480 --> 07:42.731
The people in my city

07:42.815 --> 07:45.734
have gotten fat from too many feasts.

07:45.818 --> 07:49.070
So, I hope you like your chicken
with no skin.

07:49.155 --> 07:50.822
Thanks, but I don't eat meat.

07:50.906 --> 07:52.407
How about you?

07:52.491 --> 07:54.409
I bet you like meat.

07:56.954 --> 07:58.163
Is it just me,

07:58.372 --> 08:00.874
or is this guy's crown
a little crooked?

08:01.500 --> 08:04.085
So, tell me, young bald one,

08:04.295 --> 08:05.587
where are you from?

08:06.714 --> 08:08.840
I'm from Kangaroo Island.

08:09.425 --> 08:12.010
Kangaroo Island?

08:12.094 --> 08:15.054
I hear that place is really hopping.

08:21.312 --> 08:22.312
What?

08:22.438 --> 08:23.605
It was pretty funny.

08:25.900 --> 08:29.360
All these good jokes
are making me tired.

08:29.445 --> 08:31.905
Guess it's time to hit the hay.

08:36.577 --> 08:38.620
There's an airbender in our presence,

08:38.704 --> 08:41.664
and not just any airbender...

08:41.749 --> 08:43.082
The Avatar.

08:45.503 --> 08:47.921
Now, what do you have to
say for yourself,

08:48.005 --> 08:50.298
Mr. Pippenpadlopsicopolis?

08:56.972 --> 08:59.140
Ok, you caught me.

08:59.225 --> 09:00.809
I'm the Avatar...

09:00.893 --> 09:02.393
Doing my Avatar thing,

09:02.603 --> 09:04.145
keeping the world safe.

09:04.230 --> 09:05.647
Everything checks out.

09:05.731 --> 09:07.273
No firebenders here.

09:07.358 --> 09:08.775
So, good work, everybody.

09:08.859 --> 09:09.859
Love each other,

09:09.944 --> 09:10.944
respect all life,

09:11.111 --> 09:12.946
and don't run with your spears.

09:13.030 --> 09:14.322
We'll see you next time!

09:17.451 --> 09:18.868
You can't keep us here.

09:18.953 --> 09:20.286
Let us leave!

09:21.413 --> 09:22.622
Lettuce leaf?

09:25.709 --> 09:27.210
We're in serious trouble.

09:27.419 --> 09:28.962
This guy is nuts.

09:29.338 --> 09:33.424
Tomorrow, the Avatar will face
three deadly challenges.

09:33.884 --> 09:37.303
But for now, the guards
will show you to your chamber.

09:37.388 --> 09:40.181
My liege, do you mean
the good chamber or the bad chamber?

09:40.266 --> 09:41.975
The newly-refurbished chamber.

09:42.184 --> 09:44.352
Wait. Which one are we talking about?

09:44.562 --> 09:47.146
The one that used to be
the bad chamber...

09:47.231 --> 09:49.816
Until the recent refurbishing,
that is.

09:49.900 --> 09:52.026
Of course, we've been calling it
the new chamber,

09:52.111 --> 09:53.194
but we really should
number them.

09:54.488 --> 09:56.531
Take them to the refurbished chamber

09:56.615 --> 09:58.283
that was once bad.

10:07.126 --> 10:08.668
This is a prison cell?

10:08.752 --> 10:09.919
But it's so nice.

10:10.004 --> 10:12.213
He did say it was newly refurbished.

10:12.298 --> 10:14.340
Nice or not, we're prisoners.

10:14.592 --> 10:16.843
I wonder what these challenges
are gonna be.

10:16.927 --> 10:19.012
We're not sticking around to find out.

10:19.096 --> 10:20.889
There's gotta be some way out of here.

10:20.973 --> 10:22.098
The air vents!

10:24.310 --> 10:26.019
If you think we're gonna
fit through there,

10:26.103 --> 10:27.645
you're crazier than that king.

10:27.730 --> 10:28.938
We can't.

10:29.023 --> 10:30.481
But Momo can.

10:32.985 --> 10:34.819
Momo, I need you to find Appa

10:34.904 --> 10:36.237
and bust us out of here.

10:44.246 --> 10:45.413
Go on, boy!

10:45.497 --> 10:46.956
Get Appa!

10:47.708 --> 10:50.043
How was Appa supposed to
save us anyway?

10:50.377 --> 10:52.795
Appa is a 10-ton flying bison.

10:52.880 --> 10:54.923
I think he could figure something out.

10:55.633 --> 10:58.343
Well, no point arguing about it now.

10:58.427 --> 11:00.219
Get some rest, Aang.

11:00.304 --> 11:02.013
Looks like you'll need it
for tomorrow.

11:10.814 --> 11:12.649
Sokka? Katara?

11:13.192 --> 11:14.484
Where are my friends?

11:14.860 --> 11:17.070
The king will free them
if you complete your challenges.

11:17.279 --> 11:18.947
And if I fail?

11:19.031 --> 11:20.156
He didn't say.

11:20.240 --> 11:21.240
Your staff, please?

11:27.873 --> 11:29.791
First, Avatar,

11:29.875 --> 11:31.918
what do you think of my new outfit?

11:32.002 --> 11:33.461
I want your honest opinion.

11:36.632 --> 11:38.424
I'm waiting.

11:38.550 --> 11:39.592
I...

11:39.677 --> 11:40.927
Guess it's fine.

11:41.011 --> 11:42.178
Excellent.

11:42.262 --> 11:43.888
You've passed the first test.

11:43.973 --> 11:44.973
Really?

11:45.057 --> 11:46.099
Well...

11:46.183 --> 11:47.850
Not one of the deadly tests.

11:47.935 --> 11:49.560
The real challenges are much more...

11:49.645 --> 11:50.645
Challenging.

11:53.941 --> 11:56.109
I don't have time
for your crazy games.

11:56.443 --> 11:58.277
Give me my friends back.
We're leaving!

11:58.737 --> 12:01.447
I thought you might refuse,

12:01.907 --> 12:05.785
so I will give your friends
some special souvenirs.

12:06.161 --> 12:07.662
Those delightful rings

12:07.746 --> 12:09.414
are made of pure genomite...

12:09.790 --> 12:12.583
Also known as Creeping Crystal.

12:12.835 --> 12:15.837
It's crystal that grows
remarkably fast.

12:15.921 --> 12:19.590
By nightfall, your friends will be
completely covered in it.

12:19.675 --> 12:21.092
Terrible fate, really.

12:21.176 --> 12:22.552
I can stop it,

12:22.636 --> 12:24.929
but only if you cooperate.

12:25.973 --> 12:27.598
Agh! It's already creeping!

12:29.184 --> 12:30.685
I'll do what you want.

12:36.150 --> 12:38.276
Ha ha ha ha ha!

12:42.489 --> 12:45.074
It seems I've lost my lunchbox key,

12:45.159 --> 12:46.576
and I'm hungry.

12:50.330 --> 12:52.540
There it is!

12:52.624 --> 12:54.208
Would you mind fetching it for me?

13:11.810 --> 13:12.935
Ooh!

13:13.020 --> 13:14.312
Climbing the ladder.

13:14.396 --> 13:16.272
No one's thought of that before!

13:18.901 --> 13:19.901
Aah!

13:45.010 --> 13:46.302
That's right.

13:46.386 --> 13:47.762
Keep diving head in.

13:47.846 --> 13:49.597
I'm sure it will work eventually.

14:05.322 --> 14:07.073
There! Enjoy your lunch!

14:07.282 --> 14:09.158
I want my friends back now!

14:09.326 --> 14:10.743
Not yet.

14:10.828 --> 14:12.954
I need help with another matter.

14:13.038 --> 14:16.207
It seems I've lost my pet Flopsy.

14:17.751 --> 14:18.918
Ok, found him.

14:19.002 --> 14:20.044
Bring him to me.

14:20.379 --> 14:22.713
Daddy wants a kiss from Flopsy.

14:22.881 --> 14:24.298
Come here, Flopsy.

14:25.968 --> 14:27.301
Heh heh.

14:32.349 --> 14:33.724
Flopsy, wait!

14:33.809 --> 14:34.976
Flopsy!

14:38.856 --> 14:40.022
Flopsy!

14:51.285 --> 14:52.743
Wait a minute.

14:56.415 --> 14:57.415
Flopsy?

15:03.255 --> 15:04.422
Flopsy!

15:11.722 --> 15:14.015
That's a good boy.

15:14.099 --> 15:16.434
Yes! Who has a soft belly?

15:19.062 --> 15:20.396
Guys, are you ok?

15:20.689 --> 15:23.191
Other than the crystal slowly
encasing my entire body,

15:23.275 --> 15:24.442
doing great.

15:28.864 --> 15:30.489
Yes.

15:30.866 --> 15:33.743
Come on. I'm ready
for the next challenge.

15:33.827 --> 15:36.329
Ha ha ha ha ha!

15:39.416 --> 15:42.084
Your final test is a duel.

15:42.169 --> 15:44.295
And, as a special treat,

15:44.379 --> 15:46.422
you may choose your opponent.

15:55.432 --> 15:56.599
Point and choose.

15:57.392 --> 16:00.436
So, you're saying
whoever I point to...

16:00.520 --> 16:02.021
That's the person I get to fight?

16:03.190 --> 16:04.774
Choose wisely.

16:06.693 --> 16:07.985
I...

16:08.737 --> 16:10.238
Choose...

16:10.322 --> 16:11.447
You.

16:11.531 --> 16:13.991
Ha ha. Wrong choice.

16:24.211 --> 16:25.628
Whoa!

16:26.922 --> 16:28.005
Oof!

16:40.852 --> 16:43.646
You thought I was a frail old man,

16:43.730 --> 16:47.441
but I'm the most powerful earthbender
you'll ever see.

16:47.526 --> 16:50.111
Can I fight the guy
with the ax instead?

16:50.195 --> 16:53.990
There are no take-backsies
in my kingdom.

16:54.074 --> 16:55.700
You might need this.

17:02.249 --> 17:04.417
Typical airbender tactic...

17:04.501 --> 17:06.210
Avoid and evade.

17:06.295 --> 17:09.005
I'd hoped the Avatar
would be less predictable.

17:11.591 --> 17:13.801
Don't you have any surprises for me?

17:13.885 --> 17:16.971
Sooner or later,
you'll have to strike back.

17:32.404 --> 17:35.448
You'll have to be
a little more creative than that.

17:46.335 --> 17:49.211
Did someone leave the windows open?

17:49.296 --> 17:51.797
It feels a little drafty in here.

17:51.882 --> 17:54.550
Are you hoping I'll catch a cold?

18:08.732 --> 18:12.234
How are you going to get me
from way over there?

18:34.049 --> 18:35.049
Oof!

19:19.136 --> 19:20.386
Aah!

19:28.478 --> 19:31.355
Ha ha. Well done, Avatar.

19:31.440 --> 19:34.567
You fight with much fire
in your heart.

19:46.371 --> 19:49.123
You've passed all my tests.

19:49.207 --> 19:52.251
Now, you must answer one question.

19:52.335 --> 19:53.627
That's not fair.

19:53.712 --> 19:56.255
You said you would release my friends
if I finish your tests.

19:56.339 --> 20:00.134
But what's the point of tests
if you don't learn anything?

20:00.218 --> 20:01.844
Come on!

20:01.928 --> 20:03.888
Answer this one question

20:03.972 --> 20:06.932
and I will set your friends free.

20:07.017 --> 20:09.810
What is my name?

20:11.021 --> 20:12.646
From the looks of your friends,

20:12.731 --> 20:15.357
I'd say you only have a few minutes.

20:16.276 --> 20:17.902
How am I supposed to know his name?

20:18.195 --> 20:19.612
Think about the challenges.

20:19.696 --> 20:21.155
Maybe it's some kind of riddle.

20:21.239 --> 20:22.239
-I got it!
-Yeah?

20:22.324 --> 20:24.116
He's an earthbender, right?

20:24.201 --> 20:25.284
Rocky...

20:26.703 --> 20:28.245
You know, because of all the rocks.

20:28.413 --> 20:29.455
We're gonna keep trying,

20:29.539 --> 20:30.706
but that is a good backup.

20:30.916 --> 20:33.125
Ok, so back to the challenges.

20:33.210 --> 20:35.085
I got a key from a waterfall,

20:35.170 --> 20:37.588
I saved his pet, and I had a duel.

20:37.714 --> 20:38.714
And what did you learn?

20:39.007 --> 20:42.426
Well, everything was different
than I expected.

20:42.844 --> 20:44.553
And...

20:44.930 --> 20:46.055
Well...

20:46.139 --> 20:49.099
They weren't straightforward.
To solve each test,

20:49.184 --> 20:52.561
I had to think differently
than I usually would.

20:52.646 --> 20:54.146
I know his name.

20:56.316 --> 20:59.985
I solved the question
the same way I solved the challenges.

21:00.070 --> 21:02.154
As you said a long time ago,

21:02.239 --> 21:04.990
I had to open my brain
to the possibilities.

21:08.245 --> 21:10.788
Bumi, you're a mad genius.

21:12.707 --> 21:15.668
Aang, it's good to see you.

21:15.752 --> 21:18.462
You haven't changed a bit...

21:18.547 --> 21:19.630
Literally.

21:20.382 --> 21:21.674
Over here.

21:21.758 --> 21:22.758
A little help.

21:26.680 --> 21:28.681
Genomite is made of rock candy.

21:29.849 --> 21:30.849
Delicious!

21:31.226 --> 21:34.812
So, this crazy king
is your old friend Bumi?

21:34.896 --> 21:36.313
Who you calling old?

21:36.982 --> 21:38.607
Ok, I'm old.

21:38.817 --> 21:40.276
Why did you do all this

21:40.360 --> 21:42.444
instead of just telling Aang
who you were?

21:42.612 --> 21:43.654
First of all,

21:43.738 --> 21:45.656
it's pretty fun messing with people.

21:45.740 --> 21:46.824
Ha ha.

21:46.908 --> 21:48.325
But I do have a reason.

21:48.702 --> 21:51.662
Aang, you have a difficult task ahead.

21:51.746 --> 21:54.957
The world has changed in the 100 years
you've been gone.

21:55.041 --> 21:58.252
It's the duty of the Avatar
to restore balance to the world

21:58.336 --> 22:00.754
by defeating Fire Lord Ozai.

22:00.839 --> 22:01.964
You have much to learn.

22:02.257 --> 22:04.341
You must master the four elements

22:04.426 --> 22:06.093
and confront the Fire Lord.

22:06.177 --> 22:07.636
And when you do,

22:07.721 --> 22:10.306
I hope you will think
like a mad genius.

22:13.935 --> 22:16.979
And it looks like
you're in good hands.

22:17.063 --> 22:20.524
You'll need your friends
to help you defeat the Fire Nation.

22:22.360 --> 22:24.403
And you'll need Momo, too.

22:24.654 --> 22:26.196
Thank you for your wisdom.

22:26.281 --> 22:27.906
But before we leave,

22:27.991 --> 22:29.867
I have a challenge for you.

22:31.911 --> 22:33.454
-Yeah!
-Whoo!

22:37.500 --> 22:39.043
My cabbages!
